{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bf86d6eab7ea536ae6f008866e1df5e1f6dc62f5cac7300cd48fe4b9052782d9", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の企画で、美也は\nセクシーなパジャマを着て撮影をしている）", "zh": "（美也正在穿着性感睡衣，为写真杂志《アイグラ！！》的企划进行拍摄。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "23f5a7cc14a2e09b719f9905f56d5aa973f3658c1e00141f7088435ecbffe1e4", "ja": "むむ……むむむ～？", "zh": "唔唔……唔唔唔～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d67c228d189eade18a5a60d48709c8d675e6685ac7846a10db70122dae0e435e", "ja": "そんなに唸ってどうしたんだ、美也。何か考え事か？", "zh": "怎么一直哼哼唧唧的，美也。是在想什么事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "01405ec17fce7c0d2d641ac054d5d0bda138869a4f809bfe20ee77d1b54cebb0", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\nちょっと、気になることがありまして～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n我有件在意的事想问问～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "a7fd5f668b755dfaedd2a2807a4cc4b1b82a4cf356414b223277ef3710d1558a", "ja": "{$P$}さんは\nパジャマ姿を誰かに見せることってありますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生会把穿睡衣的样子给别人看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1005_p", "source_sha256": "82c96ef33cfa3ce9c416197569345f5d3908dd89ad97203c8d73c523f4817fa3", "ja": "えっ？　うーん……\n意図して誰かに見せる状況がないからな……。", "zh": "诶？嗯……\n因为没有刻意穿着睡衣给别人看的情况……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "599339daa20e36bc81a2404ea5290b2142944f63b7cbbc194d1761bb12b7bc91", "ja": "そうですよね。パジャマにはかわいいものから\n大人なものまで、いろいろなデザインがあります。", "zh": "是啊。睡衣从可爱的款式到成熟的款式，\n有各种各样的设计呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "99e8883a740294e304bbcf739a7e21dae8f9a45c90ab9a3b1f8e16af5f9d443e", "ja": "自分だけが見る、寝るためのお洋服なのに\nたくさんの種類があるなんて……不思議ですな～。", "zh": "明明是只给自己看、睡觉时穿的衣服，却有这么多种类……真是不可思议呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1008_p", "source_sha256": "bd12ae3269f1412a0d170cad94dc52a3f24528f7b7cf9901a0f24440207a3678", "ja": "言われてみれば……。誰にも見せないなら、\n寝心地が良ければいい気もするし。", "zh": "这么说来……既然不给别人看，\n睡得舒服就行的感觉也有道理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "3e22349f939170a738ce69e159a9d9260e0a6b1291d7ce2fd543d57dd76be195", "ja": "はい～。出かけるお洋服と違いますし、\nどんなパジャマでもいいような気がします。", "zh": "是呀～。又不是出门时穿的衣服，\n感觉穿什么样的睡衣都可以呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0764e3007ac1fc273217cb9cebab412cc7d02ebb4fd99bff8370985801918baf", "ja": "出かける時と違う……あ、そうか。誰にも見せない\nからこそ、種類が必要なのかもしれない！", "zh": "和外出时不一样……啊，我明白了。正因为不会给任何人看，或许才需要准备不同种类的睡衣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "509aa09200239fa713e6cebc7a76080c48e2feb7df7f9bde701faea6ca89efc2", "ja": "おお～？　それはどういうことですか？", "zh": "哦哦～？这是怎么回事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0771588d0be2fb7c8289c7c76b1d3da3a31c030f0907d770d76aabc4aef2a3cf", "ja": "自分だけが見るパジャマなら、\n周りの目を気にせず、自由に好きな服を選べるだろ？", "zh": "如果是只有自己会看到的睡衣，不就能不用在意周围人的目光，自由选择喜欢的衣服了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1013_p", "source_sha256": "805b9d93df14f051a438dd6cfefc6ee099ef63adf49067727321f0bb2e3f7b11", "ja": "なりたい自分になれる、みたいな感じかもな。", "zh": "也许就像是能变成自己想成为的样子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "b3a7eb0e09cec6d681876a50e35efb27bcfc808b9e4a60e8f8f8d1be10f7cd05", "ja": "なりたい自分……。パジャマって、\n秘密の自分に変身するためのお洋服なんですね～。", "zh": "想成为理想中的自己……这么说来，睡衣就是为了变身成秘密的自己而穿的衣服呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "af65562e6ac59014d20e0457093226a0674fce45f7edba789b6d401db1a42272", "ja": "では、このパジャマを着ている私は\n大人っぽくなりたい私、ということになりますな～。", "zh": "那么，穿着这身睡衣的我，就是想变得成熟的我了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4ec04d6d77abcb002137a37adb7236ae7a96c844e5caf6e95957411e1f9b40fb", "ja": "うっ。そう言われると……\nちょっとドキドキしてきたような……。", "zh": "呃。被你这么一说……\n好像搞得我也有点心跳加速了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "66f24e055dcd31dbcb3152fb3c8a9783eb5c27073d864968b5a6c9a4eadebf9e", "ja": "はい……。\n自分で言っていて、私もドキドキしてきました～。", "zh": "是……自己说着说着，我也有点心跳加速了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0473_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "1ff1c964ad3a18c728b6e36b0dad04291e36a11a6f5b31b6a6192028c1e72af9", "ja": "{$P$}さん。誰にも見せたことの\nない私を見せますから、ちゃんと見ててくださいね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生。我会展现出\n从未向任何人展露过的自己，您可要好好看着哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
